  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "下午，店长不在门口了。",
      "characters": 9,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 54,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "我才敢推着车去盘点物资。",
      "characters": 11,
      "start_frame": 54,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 120,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "整家山姆一天清不完，我先记监控室附近的两排货架。",
      "characters": 22,
      "start_frame": 120,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 252,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "瓶装水，十八箱。",
      "characters": 6,
      "start_frame": 252,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 288,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "罐头十二箱，大米十二袋，每袋十公斤。",
      "characters": 15,
      "start_frame": 288,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 378,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "泡面八箱，肉干六箱，坚果四箱。",
      "characters": 12,
      "start_frame": 378,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 450,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "后面的货架，还一眼望不到头。",
      "characters": 12,
      "start_frame": 450,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 522,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "我以前只知道搬货累，现在看什么都亲切。",
      "characters": 17,
      "start_frame": 522,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 624,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "我又找了床、被子、手电和电池。",
      "characters": 12,
      "start_frame": 624,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 696,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "最贵的牛排还在冷库，面包却快到期了。",
      "characters": 16,
      "start_frame": 696,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 792,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "我把本子上的价格划掉，改成了保质期。",
      "characters": 16,
      "start_frame": 792,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 888,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "今晚，先吃面包。",
      "characters": 6,
      "start_frame": 888,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 924,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "我抱着面包回监控室，画面里突然有东西动了。",
      "characters": 19,
      "start_frame": 924,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1038,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "卸货区那辆白色面包车，车门开了。",
      "characters": 14,
      "start_frame": 1038,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1122,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "一个女人举着空水瓶，朝摄像头招手。",
      "characters": 15,
      "start_frame": 1122,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1212,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "那辆车，昨晚就停在那里。",
      "characters": 10,
      "start_frame": 1212,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1272,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    }
  ],
